{"id":10064,"name":"swampert-mega","speciesId":260,"dex":260,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["water","ground"],"stats":{"hp":100,"attack":150,"defense":110,"special-attack":95,"special-defense":110,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"swift-swim","hidden":false}],"height":19,"weight":1020,"baseExp":286,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10064.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10064.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10064.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10064.ogg","genus":"Mud Fish Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"SWAMPERT is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This POKéMON also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"SWAMPERT predicts storms by sensing subtle differences in the sounds of waves and tidal winds with its fins. If a storm is approaching, it piles up boulders to protect itself."},{"version":"emerald","text":"If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski."},{"version":"firered","text":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Swampert is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This Pokémon also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Swampert predicts storms by